The source build uses a `0.0.0` placeholder while release artifacts are stamped,
so the exact version is deliberately elided.

```console
$ utoo --version
[..]

```

`utoo x --version` is handled before registry setup and should behave like an
`npx --version` equivalent rather than trying to execute a package named
`--version`.

```console
$ utoo x --version
[..]

```
